{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "光照冒烟证据 schema(G5.3-D/E/F,步骤 85;G-G5-6;RFC-0016 章 D/E/F)",
  "description": "ci/renderer_lighting_smoke.py 写 evidence/renderer_lighting_smoke_<ts>.json。host 段恒跑 shadow/gi/rt 参考器；device 段按能力分波：W1 VSM page-mark 经 Vulkan 真派发对拍，W3 gi_probe/rtao/hard_shadow 因 rurixc ray query 编码通道与 SPIR-V 1.4 门槛保持 RD-038-W3 blocked-honest，设备能力非阻塞项。",
  "type": "object",
